tools/pipeline/ledger.json:50838:     "note": "[NOT A SEAT ANSWER] Pointer: this row was worked under `wiringcliff` as #536.  Its review is that row's nine-seat pass 2 + §F2 (panel_20260918_190341, panel_20260918_193405).  The owner ruled the re-date to 2026-09-27, so the one-block cliff this row names is RE-CREATED a week out, deliberately and dated; the row stays open for exactly that."
