I independently reproduced section R’s STALE result, its `77/85` PASS after removing only this exemption in memory, and the October 31 expiry against the committed gate. Exact Bash scorer execution was unavailable in this read-only environment; the packet’s runtime measurements remain supplied evidence.

Q6. Update both ledger rows, the exemption/discharge records, current manifest descriptions, `OUTSTANDING_BUGS.md`, and a #566 CHANGELOG block together. Record actual floor outcomes, the final gate result and elapsed time, and durable evidence paths. Keep `wiringcliff` open with IP30 removed from its remaining debt. Preserve the historical 21-row witness pair and 18-row order proof; add the current 33-row evidence separately.

